---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ProgrammeCards from "../components/ProgrammeCards.astro";
import { programmes, discovery } from "../data/institutional";
---
<BaseLayout title="Impact" description="Visio Nova Mundi CIC's approach to proportionate evidence, pilot learning and responsible reporting of public benefit.">
  <section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">Public benefit / evidence</p><h1>Measure what happens. Report what the evidence supports.</h1><p class="lead">Our impact approach distinguishes activity, learning and outcomes. Ambition, an award or CIC registration is not proof that a programme has achieved its intended benefits.</p></section>
  <section class="institutional-panel"><h2>From a baseline to a decision</h2><p>Agree the question and baseline, record delivery and voluntary participant feedback, examine implementation and limitations, then decide whether to stop, refine, continue or evaluate further. Scale is one possible outcome, not a default.</p><p>Methods, consent, data minimisation, context and evidence gaps belong alongside any reported finding. Statistically significant or transferable results depend on an appropriate study design.</p></section>
  <section class="institutional-section"><h2>Current delivery and learning</h2><ProgrammeCards items={programmes} /><p>No pilot outcomes are claimed in advance. Findings will be reported with methods and limitations when supported by delivery evidence.</p><h2>Research and proposals</h2><ProgrammeCards items={discovery} /></section>
  <section class="institutional-panel"><h2>Responsibility stays clear</h2><p>Independent founder ventures have their own objectives and responsibilities. They are not evidence of CIC programme outcomes.</p><div class="institutional-actions"><a href="/governance/">Governance and evidence standard →</a><a href="/ventures/">Independent Founder Ventures →</a><a href="/commissioners-partners/">Discuss evaluation or learning →</a></div></section>
  <style>
    .hero{max-width:88ch;padding:12px 0 14px}.eyebrow{margin:0 0 9px;color:#0f766e;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:12px;font-weight:850}h1{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,62px);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.05;color:var(--text)}h2{margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--text);font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,32px);letter-spacing:-.025em}h3{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--text);font-size:18px}.lead,p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75}.lead{margin:0;font-size:19px}.statement,.governance{margin-top:30px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:22px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(37,99,235,.07),rgba(16,185,129,.08));box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}.pathways,.cards{display:grid;gap:14px}.pathways{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin-top:16px}.pathways article,.card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;padding:17px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88)}.pathways span{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(15,118,110,.12);color:#0f766e;font-size:12px;font-weight:850}.pathways h3{margin-top:12px}.pathways p,.card p{margin:0}.pathways article p + p{margin-top:12px}.boundary{margin:16px 0 0!important;padding:13px 15px;border-left:3px solid #d97706;background:rgba(255,255,255,.58);font-size:14px}.sectionHead{margin-top:34px}.sectionHead h2{margin-bottom:0}.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));margin-top:14px}.card{box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}.card .note{margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.card a{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.card a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.governance p{margin:0;max-width:90ch}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;background:white;color:var(--text);font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.btn.primary{border-color:rgba(37,99,235,.25);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(39,99,235,.10),rgba(16,185,129,.10))}@media(max-width:800px){.pathways,.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
